  "dct_title_s": "Comitatus Lancastrensis : The countie palatine of Lancaster / Amstelodami, apud Ioan. Ianssonium.",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Relief shown pictorially.; Decorative title cartouche with fruits in upper right corner. In lower right corner, a blank cartouche. Includes illustrations of a ship and sea monster in the ocean. Also includes extensive printing flourishes.; Vignette in lower left shows Posiedon bearing a trident and standing in a shell-carriage drawn by two hippocamps.; This state was published in atlases by Jan Jansson, in 1636 and 1637.; From the Jansson Appendix Atlas 1636-1680, title created to represent a unique collection within the Clark Library, University of Michigan.",
